# The Caddy image build uses the repo root (/opt/mcp on the host) as its
# context; the build COPYs nothing from it, so this only trims what gets
# sent to the docker daemon: the graph data (grows unbounded), secrets,
# and everything else that isn't build input.
.git/
data/
.env
services/
terraform/
scripts/
caddy/
Makefile
*.md
